-    "> **Revision note (v4)**: besides the 16-method filter comparison (5-fold CV), the notebook now runs **difficulty sweeps** (blur sigma, noise, input resolution, amount of training data; Section 22) and a **filter x noise grid** (Section 23), because one fixed difficulty saturates at 100%. Section 24 draws the **reference 10-graph set** (accuracy bars, class-wise bars, dual axis, confusion matrices, learning curves, fold heat map, over/under-fit verdicts, radar, GPU timeline, dashboard) for every experiment group. Sections 5-8 stay as a development sanity check and are not held-out.\n",
